<title>USA: 3Com Q4 shr $0.48.</title>
<headline>3Com Q4 shr $0.48.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CLARA, Calif. 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>3Com Corporation</p>
<p>		    Consolidated Statements of Income</p>
<p>		  (In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>				Quarter Ended	   Year Ended</p>
<p>			    May 31,   May 31,    May 31,    May 31,</p>
<p>				 1997	1996	1997	 1996</p>
<p>				 (Unaudited)</p>
<p> Sales		    $829,892 $660,266 $3,147,106 $2,327,101</p>
<p> Cost of Sales	   396,081  309,758  1,452,350  1,096,846</p>
